{
	"nodes":[
		{"id":"b52af27702db5959","x":-238,"y":-184,"width":958,"height":664,"type":"text","text":"My mother Theresa Torvir a drow who never told me where she was from met a man of noble blood who became my father in the volstarian dynasty. My father always speaks highly of my mom and says that she's blessed with amazing gifts and he wanted my older sister Lilette Torvir to follow in her footsteps. When Lilette turned 12 she began studying at Hellos academy. On the year of her graduation after she turned 18, tragedy struck the aracanist in charge of plainer teachings and conjuration, made a fatal error in one of her magic circles period. Fortunately for everyone else but my family nobody other than my sister was harmed or missing. After the incident things were never the same in my household my father began drinking, and my mom locked her tomes and sealed them shut forever. Shortly after my parents told me I’m not allowed to attend the academy, I was deeply bothered by this. I looked up to Lilette and wanted to follow in her footsteps. I wanted to find out what happened to her so I began to lash out (in childish ways ofcourse, you donkey) I would draw things on my dads face while he slept, I’d move the bookmarks in my moms books, one time I put a water bucket at the top of my balcony and pushed it onto my dad while he was walking home. Every time I couldn’t think of a prank to pull I’d hear a whisper in my ear giving me the best ideas. Eventually these whispers turned into a person (Schizophrenia oath) a small girl cloaked in a blue cape. She was my first friend and she loved having fun with me. My friend started teaching me new tricks with magic. When my parents discovered my use of magic they were both worried and curious at the same time. My mother began to question me asking why I pulled all these pranks, where the magic came from and how I learned how to use it. It’s like she knew, she knew Revilya existed and I broke and told her everything. She was outraged and told me I could never use magic agaidn and to never speak to Revilya again. That she was a curse, a burden. My father was more open, he told me that I could go to him about things like this, and that he wanted to meet Revilya. She refused she told me she couldn’t show herself to anyone else or I’d never see her again. It was at that time that she dropped her disguise and showed her true self to me.\n\nShe told me that she could help me find my sister, but I had to help her with whatever she wanted me to do. In desperation I accepted and was given gifts (Nintendo Switch 2 for cheap) beyond my capacity of imagination. After some time honing my skills, seeking guidance from my dad while hiding it from my mom. I began on a quest, I told my mom that I was gonna look for my sister with or without your help. I left my house at age 18, I spent 3 years on the road. Just me and Revilya, but she’s not there all the time. Sometime down the road Revilya gave me a companion, a sprite (I love that drink) named [Insert Name]. I eventually was passing by the Xroas stronghold. When I reached the stronghold they took me prisoner and left me to rot in the bottom of a mansion. Recently, about 10 minutes ago I heard a lot of explosions (GANG WHAT HTE FUKKKKKKKKKK is goin on)"},
		{"id":"fe1c0e338a900fd6","x":-465,"y":-367,"width":250,"height":60,"type":"text","text":"[[Valrich Torvier.canvas]]\n#PlayerCharacter "}
